        "rerank_score": 0.0189,
        "snippet": "\u00a7 7053. Contract Requirements for Third Parties.\n\u00a7 7053. Contract Requirements for Third Parties.\n\n(a)\nA business that sells or shares a consumer\u2019s personal information with a thir..."
