        "rerank_score": 0.0353,
        "snippet": "\u00a7 7220. Pre-use Notice Requirements.\n\u00a7 7220. Pre-use Notice Requirements.\n\n(a)\nA business that uses ADMT as set forth in section 7200, subsection (a), must\nprovide consumers with a..."
      }
