    "eval_id": "eval_7121_002",
    "query": "After the initial phased rollout concludes on April 1, 2030, what is the annual recurring timeframe and audit period for completing subsequent cybersecurity audit reports?",
    "target_section": "7121",
    "expected_route": "POLICY_LOOKUP",
    "actual_route": "POLICY_LOOKUP",
    "route_correct": true,
    "route_reasoning": "Standard regulatory policy lookup targeting active 2026 regulations.",
    "answerable": true,
    "abstained": false,
    "section_hit": true,
    "hit_in_top_1": true,
    "precision_at_k": 0.5,
    "key_term_recall": 0.0,
    "citation_valid": true,
    "ground_truth_answer": "Under \u00a7 7121(b), after April 1, 2030, if a business meets section 7120 criteria on January 1 of a year for the preceding year, the business must complete a cybersecurity audit covering the next 12 calendar months, and file the audit report by April 1 of the following year (e.g., meeting criteria on Jan 1, 2035 requires an audit from Jan 1, 2035 to Jan 1, 2036, with report due April 1, 2036).",
    "generated_answer": "Based on the provided regulatory text, here is the timeline for cybersecurity audit reports following the initial rollout:\n\n### Annual Recurring Requirements (\u00a7 7121(b))\nAfter April 1, 2030, the requirement for subsequent cybersecurity audits follows a consistent annual cycle for businesses that meet the criteria defined in section 7120:\n\n*   **Assessment Period:** If a business meets the criteria on January 1 of a given year, it must conduct an audit covering the next 12 months (e.g., January 1 through January 1 of the following year).\n*   **Completion Deadline:** The business must complete its cybersecurity audit report by **April 1 of the following year**.\n*   **Example:** As specified in \u00a7 7121(b), if a business meets the criteria on January 1, 2035, the audit must cover January 1, 2035, through January 1, 2036. The report must then be completed by April 1, 2036.\n\n### Certification Deadline (\u00a7 7124)\nIn addition to completing the audit report, the business must submit a written certification to the California Privacy Protection Agency (CPPA):\n\n*   **Submission Deadline:** The certification must be submitted no later than **April 1** following any year that the business is required to complete an audit (\u00a7 7124(b)).\n*   **Compliance Note:** This certification must be submitted by a member of the executive management team who holds the authority and knowledge required under \u00a7 7124(c) and must be submitted via the Agency's website at https://cppa.ca.gov/ (\u00a7 7124(d)).\n\n***Note on Scope:** While this response covers the timing and procedural requirements for recurring audits, the provided context does not define the specific criteria under \"section 7120\" that trigger the initial requirement for a business to perform an audit after the 2030 threshold.*",
    "semantic_similarity": 0.8478,
