        "rerank_score": 0.9872,
        "snippet": "\u00a7 7302. Probable Cause Proceedings.\n(a) Probable Cause. Under Civil Code section 1798.199.50, probable cause exists\nwhen the evidence supports a reasonable belief that the CCPA has..."
      },
