        "rerank_score": 0.9995,
        "snippet": "\u00a7 7062. Verification for Non-Accountholders.\n\u00a7 7062. Verification for Non-Accountholders.\n\n(a)\nIf a consumer does not have or cannot access a password-protected account\nwith a busi..."
      },
      {
