    "key_term_recall": 0.6,
    "citation_valid": true,
    "ground_truth_answer": "Under \u00a7 7003(b)(3), online disclosures must follow generally recognized industry standards, specifically the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG), version 2.1 of June 5, 2018, from the World Wide Web Consortium. For non-online contexts, the business must provide instructions on how a consumer with a disability may access the policy in an alternative format.",
    "generated_answer": "To ensure that online disclosures are accessible to consumers with disabilities, a business must follow generally recognized industry standards. Specifically, under **\u00a7 7003(b)(3)**, businesses must follow the **Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG), version 2.1 of June 5, 2018**, from the World Wide Web Consortium.",
