        "rerank_score": 0.8243,
        "snippet": "\u00a7 7004. Requirements for Methods for Submitting CCPA Requests and Obtaining\n(a)\nExcept as expressly allowed by the CCPA and these regulations, businesses\nshall design and implement..."
