        "snippet": "\u00a7 7123. Scope of Cybersecurity Audit and Audit Report.\n\u00a7 7123. Scope of Cybersecurity Audit and Audit Report.\n\n(a)\nThe cybersecurity audit must assess how the business\u2019s cybersecur..."
