        "rerank_score": 0.3979,
        "snippet": "\u00a7 7220. Pre-use Notice Requirements.\n(e) A business may provide a consolidated Pre-use Notice as set forth below,\nprovided that the consolidated Pre-use Notice includes the informa..."
      },
      {
        "parent_id": "v2026_sec7220_p1",
        "section": "7220",
