  {
    "eval_id": "eval_7023_003",
    "query": "What special right must a business inform a consumer about if it denies a request to correct health-related personal information?",
    "target_section": "7023",
    "expected_route": "POLICY_LOOKUP",
    "actual_route": "POLICY_LOOKUP",
    "route_correct": true,
    "route_reasoning": "Standard regulatory policy lookup targeting active 2026 regulations.",
    "answerable": true,
    "abstained": false,
    "section_hit": true,
    "hit_in_top_1": true,
    "precision_at_k": 0.3333,
    "key_term_recall": 0.4,
    "citation_valid": true,
    "ground_truth_answer": "Under \u00a7 7023(f)(3), if a business denies a request to correct health information, it must inform the consumer that they may provide a written statement of up to 250 words per alleged inaccurate piece of information to be included with their record pursuant to Civil Code \u00a7 1798.185(a)(78)(D). Upon request, the business must make this statement available to any person to whom the health data is disclosed, shared, or sold.",
    "generated_answer": "If a business denies a consumer's request to correct personal information that was collected and analyzed concerning the consumer's health, it must inform the consumer that they have the right to provide a written statement to the business to be made part of their record, pursuant to **\u00a7 7023(f)(3)**.\n\nWhen providing this notification, the business must also include the following explanations:\n\n*   **Statement Limitation**: The written statement is limited to 250 words per alleged inaccurate piece of personal information (**\u00a7 7023(f)(3)**).\n*   **Request Requirement**: The consumer must explicitly request that the statement be made part of their record (**\u00a7 7023(f)(3)**).\n*   **Business Obligations**: Upon receiving such a statement, the business is required to include it with the consumer\u2019s record. Furthermore, upon the consumer's request, the business must make that statement available to any person with whom it discloses, shares, or sells the personal information that was the subject of the request to correct (**\u00a7 7023(f)(3)**).",
    "semantic_similarity": 0.9113,
