    "key_term_recall": 0.0,
    "citation_valid": true,
    "ground_truth_answer": "Under \u00a7 7102(a)(2), a business meeting the 10 million consumer threshold must disclose the compiled metric information by July 1 of every calendar year. The information must be published within the business's privacy policy or posted on its website and accessible via a link included in its privacy policy.",
    "generated_answer": "Based on the provided regulatory context, businesses that meet the criteria of collecting, buying, selling, or sharing the personal information of 10,000,000 or more consumers in a calendar year must adhere to the following requirements regarding request metrics:\n\n*   **Deadline:** Businesses must disclose the required metrics by **July 1 of every calendar year** [\u00a7 7102(a)(2)].\n*   **Location of Disclosure:** The information must be disclosed within the business\u2019s **privacy policy** or posted on the business\u2019s **website** where it is accessible from a link included in their privacy policy [\u00a7 7102(a)(2)].\n\nThe metrics to be compiled and disclosed cover the previous calendar year and include the number of requests received, complied with (in whole or in part), and denied for the following categories:\n*   Requests to delete [\u00a7 7102(a)(1)(A)]\n*   Requests to correct [\u00a7 7102(a)(1)(B)]\n*   Requests to know [\u00a7 7102(a)(1)(C)]\n*   Requests to access ADMT (Automated Decision-Making Technology) [\u00a7 7102(a)(1)(D)]\n*   Requests to opt-out of sale/sharing [\u00a7 7102(a)(1)(E)]\n*   Requests to limit [\u00a7 7102(a)(1)(F)]\n*   Requests to opt-out of ADMT [\u00a7 7102(a)(1)(G)]\n*   The median or mean number of days taken to substantively respond to requests to delete, correct, know, opt-out of sale/sharing, and limit [\u00a7 7102(a)(1)(H)].",
    "semantic_similarity": 0.8712,
