    "citation_valid": true,
    "ground_truth_answer": "Yes. Under \u00a7 7102(b), a business may choose to compile and disclose the metrics for requests received from all individuals globally rather than just California consumers. However, the business must explicitly state in its disclosure that it has done so, and it must be prepared to compile and provide California-only consumer metrics to the Attorney General upon request.",
